# Phase 08 evidence noise, untracked on 2026-11-01 (copies stay local).
# Emulator step logs in these two finished runs repeat their same-name .json
# records field for field. The kept logs either hold events their JSON lacks
# (interrupted runs) or are linked from a report. New run folders stay tracked:
# a step log is the only record when a run dies before writing its JSON.
docs/reports/evidence/phase-08-emulator-expansion/ex20261028/*.log
docs/reports/evidence/phase-08-emulator-expansion/st20261031/*.log
